      "text": "Delft’s Dutch-taught Mechanical Engineering bachelor studies the physical behaviour and design of devices and mechanical systems. Mathematics, mechanics, materials, thermal and fluid processes and control are developed through theory, laboratories and repeated design projects, followed by a minor and a final research or design project."
    },
    {
      "path": "audience.comparisonExplanation",
      "text": "UCR offers genuine connections through mathematical modelling, robot motion, product design and renewable-energy study. These do not form a sustained programme centred on the physical analysis and integrated design of mechanical systems. A full UCR comparison is therefore not offered."
